# This directory contains entity logos for the Tech Radar
#
# Logos are displayed in entity detail modals as 64x64px circular images.
#
# Run the following command to download and process logos:
#   ./scripts/download-logos.sh
#
# Logo naming convention: {vendor}-logo-64x64.{webp|png}
# Examples:
#   - postgresql-logo-64x64.webp
#   - kubernetes-logo-64x64.webp
#   - python-logo-64x64.png
